# alt_auto_takeoff.expect — ALT_HOLD ARM-triggered auto-takeoff gates (redesign 2026-06-14)
# ALT_HOLD の ARM トリガ自動離陸ゲート
#
# Chain: mode change accepted while DISARMED on the ground (BEFORE "ARM accepted")
# → ARM in ALT_HOLD: props STOPPED through the spool dwell (duty ≈ 0 in [7.55,7.78])
# → ARM triggers the auto-takeoff (NO throttle) → climb to the 0.5 m TARGET → controller
# CAPTURES the target (Auto-takeoff complete) → holds ~0.5 m (decision ②: the target
# value, not the climb-overshoot peak). The ToF 0.15 m airborne edge is the ESKF handoff.
# 連鎖: 地上 DISARM 中のモード変更受理（"ARM accepted" 前）→ ALT_HOLD で ARM: スプール
# ドウェル中プロペラ停止（[7.55,7.78] で duty ≈ 0）→ ARM が自動離陸をトリガ（スロットルなし）
# → 0.5 m 目標へ上昇 → 制御器が目標を捕捉（Auto-takeoff complete）→ ~0.5 m 保持（確定②:
# 行き過ぎピークでなく目標値）。ToF 0.15 m 空中エッジは ESKF ハンドオフ。
exit 0
log_contains any "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD"
log_contains any "ARM accepted"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff engaged"
log_contains any "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
log_contains any "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
order "Mode change: STABILIZE → ALT_HOLD" "ARM accepted"
order "ARM accepted" "Auto-takeoff engaged"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Vertical handoff: takeoff"
order "Auto-takeoff engaged" "Auto-takeoff complete — normal mode law engaged"
metric duty_max < 0.05 in 7.55 7.78
metric alt_mean > 0.42 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_mean < 0.62 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_rmse < 0.08 in 12.0 16.0
metric alt_band < 0.20 in 12.0 16.0
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 12.0 16.0
metric tilt_max < 10.0 in 9.0 16.0
